    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d426-a1-a1-a7">

                <pb facs="0752" n="682" xml:id="pg682"/>

                <head>[Telegram.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">San Luis Potosi,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1887-06-20"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 20, 1887—10.15 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">To Baron de Lago, in Tacubaya:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The President of the republic has instructed me to say to you, in reply to your
                    telegram of yesterday, which was received this night, that, for important
                    reasons, you cannot have the disposal of Maximilian’s body.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>S. LERDO DE TEJADA.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
